              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#hcind1" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hcind1">How do you ensure HIPAA compliance?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="hcind1" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#healthcareIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">We build HIPAA compliance into the architecture from day one: end-to-end encryption, role-based access controls, complete audit logging, secure authentication (MFA), and regular security assessments. We provide a Business Associate Agreement (BAA) and compliance documentation for your records.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#hcind2" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hcind2">Can you integrate with our EHR system?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="hcind2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#healthcareIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Yes. We have experience with Epic, Cerner, Athenahealth, eClinicalWorks, AllScripts, Practice Fusion, and more. We use standard HL7 and FHIR protocols. For proprietary or legacy systems, we can build custom integrations.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#hcind3" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hcind3">What happens if there's a security breach or HIPAA violation?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="hcind3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#healthcareIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">We design systems with multiple layers of security to prevent breaches. In the unlikely event of an incident, we have documented incident response procedures, breach notification protocols, and forensic analysis capabilities. We work with you to meet HHS breach notification requirements.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#hcind4" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hcind4">How long does a typical healthcare project take?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="hcind4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#healthcareIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Basic automation (scheduling, reminders) can be completed in 8–12 weeks. Comprehensive platforms with EHR integration typically take 16–20 weeks. Complex multi-location implementations may take 6–9 months. We recommend a phased approach for large projects.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#hcind5" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hcind5">Can patients access the system on mobile devices?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="hcind5" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#healthcareIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Yes. All our solutions are mobile-responsive and work on smartphones and tablets. We can also build native iOS and Android apps. Patients can schedule, message providers, view lab results, and pay bills from their devices.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#hcind6" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hcind6">What about elderly patients who aren't tech-savvy?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="hcind6" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#healthcareIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">We design for all patient demographics. Interfaces are simple and intuitive with large text, clear navigation, and phone support. We maintain traditional channels (phone, in-person) while offering digital options. Many practices see 70%+ adoption even among elderly populations.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#hcind7" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hcind7">How much does healthcare technology implementation cost?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="hcind7" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#healthcareIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Costs vary by scope and practice size. Basic automation starts around $30–50K. Comprehensive platforms with EHR integration range from $80–200K+. We offer phased implementations to spread costs and deliver value quickly with an MVP approach.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#hcind8" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hcind8">Do you provide ongoing support and maintenance?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="hcind8" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#healthcareIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Yes. We offer ongoing support including software updates, security patches, compliance monitoring, technical support, and feature enhancements. We provide training for new staff and can manage the system on your behalf if desired.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#hcind9" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hcind9">Can you help us migrate data from our old system?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="hcind9" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#healthcareIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">Yes. We provide data migration for patient records, appointment history, clinical data, and financial information. We ensure data integrity, map data properly, and perform thorough testing before go-live. We can run systems in parallel during transition if needed.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="accordion-item border rounded mb-2">
              <h3 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#hcind10" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="hcind10">How do you measure success in healthcare projects?</button>
              </h3>
              <div id="hcind10" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#healthcareIndustryFaq">
                <div class="accordion-body">We focus on measurable outcomes: no-show rate reduction, staff time savings, patient satisfaction improvement, revenue recovery, appointment volume increase, and clinical efficiency gains. We establish baseline metrics during discovery and track improvements post-launch.</div>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

